    title: Offers And Time Skip
    summary: Offers choose temporary shop rewards from a weighted pool; TimeSkipBoost
      applies offline-style production instantly.
    resourcePrefix: demo_offers
    sections:
    - heading: Project setup
      body: Add offer pool entries to OffersManager, create ShopManager holders before
        using group-backed entries, and use TimeSkipBoost for purchases or ads that
        simulate production time.
